    {
      "name": "Tongue Grab If",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Grouloop hits a creature with her tongue, that creature becomes grabbed. Unlike with a normal grab, the creature isn't immobilized, but it can't move beyond the reach of Grouloop's tongue. A creature can sever the tongue by hitting AC 24 and dealing at least 9 slashing damage. Though this doesn't deal any damage to the boggard, it prevents her from using her tongue Strike until she regrows her tongue, which takes a week."
      ]
    }
